# wasm-pack's `--target web` output for apps/hacienda-studio's `hacienda-wasm`
# file: dependency. This directory is NOT rebuilt at Vercel deploy time (no Rust
# toolchain in Vercel's build image) — the files below are intentionally committed
# and must be regenerated + recommitted (`task build:wasm`) whenever
# crates/hacienda-wasm/** or hacienda-core/** changes. CI enforces freshness —
# see .github/workflows/ci-wasm-freshness.yaml.
*
!.gitignore
!package.json
!hacienda_wasm.js
!hacienda_wasm.d.ts
!hacienda_wasm_bg.wasm
!hacienda_wasm_bg.wasm.d.ts